workflow date_range_syntax v1
  now range >=2026-01-01 <=2027-12-31 offset +25:00
description "Ranges of dates and times, written wrongly: each end is a day the calendar has, some day is in the range, only a time and the period take an offset, and the offset is one koyomi reads"

record Mistakes
  held        : date       range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-12-31
  held_time   : timestamp  range >=2026-01-01 offset +09:00
  no_day      : date       range >=2026-02-30
  none_in     : date       range >=2026-12-31 <=2026-01-01
  none_at     : timestamp  range >=2026-12-31 <=2026-01-01 offset -05:00
  a_number    : date       range >=1 <=31
  a_name      : timestamp  range >=today
  dated_int   : int        range >=2026-01-01
  date_offset : date       range >=2026-01-01 offset +09:00
  far_offset  : timestamp  range <=2026-12-31 offset +09:60
  a_text      : string     range >=2026-01-01

flow
  pass
